SUMMARY:[Branner Earth Sciences Library / Stanford University Libraries] B
 ranner Library Monthly Book & Map Exhibit - Mapping the Oceans
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260817
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260817
DTSTAMP:20260816T133124Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-53305547834880-53305563446673@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Branner Earth Sciences Library & Map Collection exhibit series
 : Oceans\n\nIn the 2025–2026 academic year\, Branner Library’s exhibit
  series will explore Earth’s oceans’ complex biological and ecological
  systems that regulate climate and support life.\n\nJuly–August’s exhi
 bition explores the history\, science\, and technologies used to chart Ear
 th’s largest environment. The collection highlights how cartographers\, 
 navigators\, geologists\, and oceanographers have transformed our understa
 nding of the ocean\n\nAges: All ages\nLast synced: 2026-08-16 06:31 PDT
LOCATION:Mitchell Earth Sciences
END:VEVENT
